- The deliberation has reached unanimous consensus on option E (397).
- Colleagues 7 and 10 have fully retracted earlier considerations of H (384) and D (412), recognizing that Devil defense in defensive stance evaluates strictly to 26 under HoMM3 mechanics, eliminating any engine pathway to 24.
- All participants agree on the core parameters: base damage of 150, attacking Attack of 49, defending Defense of 26, yielding an attack differential of 23 (+1.15) alongside the additive +0.50 hatred bonus. Active spells and irrelevant secondary skills provide no modification.
- Total damage evaluates to floor(150 * 2.65) = 397, confirming E as the definitive choice.
}

